<section class="section" id="record-deeper">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head section-head--run">
      <h2 class="headline-run">Follow the record deeper. <span>The same asset record carries your sensor data, your environmental obligations, and your engineering information.</span></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="rail rail--story" role="group" aria-label="What the asset record holds">
      <div class="rail-controls">
        <button class="rail-btn" type="button" data-rail="prev" aria-label="Scroll cards left">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 5 8 12l7 7"/></svg>
        </button>
        <button class="rail-btn" type="button" data-rail="next" aria-label="Scroll cards right">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="rail-track" tabindex="0">
        <article class="rail-card">
          <div class="rail-card-media rail-card-media--telemetry">
            <img class="rail-card-icon" src="/static/img/icons/sensor-feeds.svg" width="64" height="64" alt="">
            <h3 class="rail-card-title">Asset telemetry</h3>
          </div>
          <p>SCADA, IIoT, and production readings, stored on the asset.</p>
          <a class="text-action" href="/assets/telemetry">See asset telemetry</a>
        </article>
        <article class="rail-card">
          <div class="rail-card-media rail-card-media--compliance">
            <img class="rail-card-icon" src="/static/img/icons/compliance.svg" width="64" height="64" alt="">
            <h3 class="rail-card-title">Asset compliance</h3>
          </div>
          <p>The record decides which air, water, and waste rules apply.</p>
          <a class="text-action" href="/assets/compliance">See asset compliance</a>
        </article>
        <article class="rail-card">
          <div class="rail-card-media rail-card-media--depreciation">
            <img class="rail-card-icon" src="/static/img/icons/aggregate.svg" width="64" height="64" alt="">
            <h3 class="rail-card-title">Asset value &amp; utilization</h3>
          </div>
          <p>Book value beside run hours, so units you pay for and don't run show up.</p>
          <a class="text-action" href="/assets/operations">See operational excellence</a>
        </article>
        <article class="rail-card">
          <div class="rail-card-media rail-card-media--attributes">
            <img class="rail-card-icon" src="/static/img/icons/assets.svg" width="64" height="64" alt="">
