          <p>Ready-made attributes per equipment type. Add your own per class.</p>
          <a class="text-action" href="/assets/operations">See the data foundation</a>
        </article>
        <article class="rail-card">
          <div class="rail-card-media rail-card-media--location">
            <img class="rail-card-icon" src="/static/img/icons/location.svg" width="64" height="64" alt="">
            <h3 class="rail-card-title">Asset location</h3>
          </div>
          <p>Where the asset is now and everywhere it has been.</p>
          <a class="text-action" href="/trek">See Trek field capture</a>
        </article>
        <article class="rail-card">
          <div class="rail-card-media rail-card-media--association">
            <img class="rail-card-icon" src="/static/img/icons/workflows.svg" width="64" height="64" alt="">
